  "title": "JAMANVAAR | Restaurant Admin",
  "text": "Dish created!\nQA-Restaurant-A-1792232615381\nRESTAURANT ADMIN\nQA-Branch-A\nCtrl+K\nNo open shift\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLogout\nBranch\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nQA-Restaurant-A-1792232615381 — Main Branch · MAIN\nQA-Branch-A · QAA\nQA-Branch-A2 · QA2\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nDAILY\nToday\nOrders\nMenu\nCustomers & loyalty\nDevices & sync\nOPERATIONS\nKIOSK MANAGEMENT\nQR ORDERING\nREPORTS\nSETUP\nShared restaurant menu\nQA-Restaurant-A-1792232615381 · QA-Branch-A\n\nDish names, prices, categories and photos are shared across licensed apps. Publication updates the guest menu. Use channel availability and branch overrides to limit where a dish is offered.\n\nMenu & Catalog Manager\n1 ITEMS\n\nCreate, edit dishes, adjust pricing, upload device photos, and import templates.\n\nPublish to QR / Kiosk\nAdd Dish\nAdd Category\nLoad Menu Template\nUpload CSV\nDownload CSV Template\nExport Menu CSV\nBulk Price Adjust\nClean Duplicate Items\nChannel Consistency Check\nAll Diets\nVeg\nNon-Veg\nEgg\nJain\nVegan\nAll Categories\n1 dishes\nQA Pizza\n1 dishes\nQA-PIZZA-01\nQA Pizza 01\n₹249\n\nAvailable\nCombos & Meal Deals\n0 COMBOS\n\nBundle dishes into a fixed-price deal with an automatic savings badge.\n\nCreate Combo\nNo Combos Yet\n\nBundle popular dishes into a discounted combo to increase average order value on Kiosk and QR ordering.\n\n+ Create First Combo\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE\nDisplay",
